# Redaction self-test of the `redact` table option (harness.slt.redact_table; not a test case): run over
# canary/tables_redact.txt without --redact, and with --mutate canary, which makes antb1's first value a sentinel.
# The report must print neither the SQL nor a value.

query I nosort
SELECT COUNT(*) /* ANTB1_CANARY_SQL */ FROM antb1_canary_table
----
12
